This project cleans and joins the source records, aggregates reviews per order, translates category labels, replaces long identifiers with compact internal keys for the report snapshot, and creates derived analytical summaries.

The licence applies to source and derived data, including `powerbi/Data`, `powerbi/SourceKeys`, the embedded records in `powerbi/Olist.SemanticModel/model.bim`, `web/data.json`, `web/data.json.gz`, and data-derived analytical output. Reuse must retain attribution, be noncommercial and comply with the share-alike conditions. The MIT licence for original project code does not override these data terms.

The Olist name is used only to identify the public dataset. This independent student portfolio is not affiliated with or endorsed by Olist.
